From e5472efb316b36de5ea96ff8de335c8c343e5c50 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: J P <1953637+jpwatters@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:36:59 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 54/54] Project PDF for v2.1.2-NAS

Built by tools/nas-kit/doc/build_pdf.py from project.md, the folder's git
history (change history) and its code (listings), so it names the release it
describes. Section 9, "Keeping up with upstream: what each release changed",
lists for every port from v1.20.5 to v2.1.2 what stopped the patches and how
it was resolved (v2.1.2: upstream took settings bits 163-168 and drawer section 57, so the relay setting is 169 and the radio buttons 58-60; v2.1.0: the series was rebased, because the
patches added since v2.0.2 had no base for git am's three-way merge). It
covers the relay's Remote Power-ON, the Tab5's and the web page's Power on /
Power off the radio, and QMX Bridge, the native Mac app.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W7MAsxUnuCnfwkHxdqp61S
